# Opus Java programs rerun without a time limit (owner 2026-11-09). brain02 (their javaout builds are here). Joins against the specifications and the Rust twin whose exports exist.
XCE.pineapple-paper.impl_1_fifo.w16.cinf 250 8640000 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/jmc-run.sh cf-pineapple-paper 'bench.pineapple_paper.PineapplePaper:impl,1,fifo' must 0 1 export.jsonl 8640000 --split 16 --k 1
XJ1.pineapple-paper.impl_1_fifo.vs-derived.tfspec-jmcimpl.cinf.m 250 8640000 needok:XCE.pineapple-paper.impl_1_fifo.w16.cinf "$EVAL_OUT"/tf-merge-target/release/conf-join --merge "$EVAL_OUT"/C3E.pineapple-derived.spec_1_fifo.t16.c48h/export.jsonl "$EVAL_OUT"/XCE.pineapple-paper.impl_1_fifo.w16.cinf/export.jsonl
